========================================================================
Day 200 closed form for tau_r(q,t).
========================================================================

Coefficients (independent of r):
  A = -(q - 1)*(q + 1)*(q - t - 1)/((t - 1)*(t + 1))
  B = t*(q - 1)*(q + 1)*(q - t)/(t - 1)
  C = -q*t**3*(q - 1)*(q + 1)/((t - 1)*(t + 1))

Closed form:  tau_r(q,t) = (A + B t^r + C t^(2r)) / q^3.

Alternative pretty form (pull out K = -(q^2-1)/(t^2-1)):
  tau_r(q,t) = K/q^3 * [ (q-t-1) - (t+1)(q-t) t^(r+1) + q t^(2r+3) ]

